Optional Qore TypeScript catalogue
==================================

Activate explicitly for a Qore process with:

 export QORE_TYPESCRIPT_MASTER_ACTION_SCRIPT=/usr/share/qore-v8-app-catalogue/dist/index.js

Then load TypeScriptActionInterface or use Qore's data-provider tools. The package
includes production JavaScript dependencies, not Jest or development tools.
Service credentials are provided separately by the application. Installed files
are immutable; application indexes and caches belong in application-owned paths.

This local prototype has not been cleared for public redistribution. See
schema-provenance.json and the dependency notices for outstanding provenance.
